      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "- Spacious five-bedroom detached family home extending to approximately 149 sq. m. (1,603 sq. ft.).\r\n\r\n- Versatile ground-floor bedroom, also ideal as a family room or additional living space.\r\n\r\n- Four further bedrooms upstairs, including master bedroom with en-suite.\r\n\r\nSmith Harrington are delighted to bring to the market No. 12 Portersgate Close, an impressive five-bedroom detached family home extending to approximately 149 sq. m. (1,603 sq. ft.), ideally positioned within the highly sought-after and mature Portersgate development.\r\n\r\nThe property offers generous and versatile accommodation arranged over two floors, providing an excellent opportunity for families seeking a spacious home in a well-established residential setting. A particular feature is the ground-floor bedroom, which offers considerable flexibility and could also be utilised as a family room, playroom, home office or additional living space depending on the purchaser's requirements.\r\n\r\nOn entering, the welcoming entrance hall provides access to the guest WC and the principal living accommodation. The sitting room offers a comfortable main reception space, while the separate dining room and sunroom provide excellent additional areas for family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen cum breakfast room is well proportioned and provides a practical space for everyday family life, complemented by a separate utility room. The ground-floor bedroom is generously proportioned and provides an excellent option for those looking for bedroom accommodation on the ground floor or additional flexible living space.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are four further bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite. The remaining bedrooms are well proportioned and provide excellent accommodation for a growing family, guests or those requiring dedicated space for home working. A family bathroom and landing complete the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a front garden with off-street parking for two cars. To the rear is a private south-east facing garden, offering a pleasant outdoor setting for relaxing, entertaining and family enjoyment. The garden is complemented by a substantial shed measuring approximately 3.47m x 5.77m, providing excellent additional storage.\r\n\r\nPortersgate is a mature and highly sought-after residential development, offering a peaceful family setting while remaining exceptionally convenient to a wide range of amenities. Clonsilla Train Station is within a short walk, providing excellent commuter access to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nThe surrounding area is well served by a selection of primary and secondary schools, local shops, supermarkets, parks, playgrounds and sporting facilities. Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is also within easy reach, providing an extensive range of retail, leisure and dining facilities.\r\n\r\nFor commuters, the property enjoys excellent access to the M50 motorway, providing convenient links to Dublin Airport, Dublin City Centre and the wider road network.\r\n\r\nCombining generous accommodation, a versatile ground-floor bedroom/family room, four further bedrooms upstairs, private south-east facing gardens and an excellent commuter location, No. 12 Portersgate Close represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious detached family home in a highly desirable residential setting.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the space, versatility and convenient location this property has to offer."
      },
